159
00:12:18,179 --> 00:12:19,720
[SPEAKER_00]: Well, they worked down there.

160
00:12:21,281 --> 00:12:33,351
[SPEAKER_00]: They worked down there and they finally got to the point that somebody here in the United States would sign for them, you know, coming in here.

161
00:12:33,371 --> 00:12:34,552
