162
00:12:34,572 --> 00:12:36,293
[SPEAKER_02]: They had to do that, didn't they?

163
00:12:36,353 --> 00:12:37,754
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, they had to do that.

164
00:12:39,513 --> 00:12:40,814
