165
00:12:40,854 --> 00:12:42,535
[SPEAKER_02]: He had a trade then?

166
00:12:42,896 --> 00:12:48,480
[SPEAKER_00]: No, it was just in this steel mill.

167
00:12:49,521 --> 00:12:54,485
[SPEAKER_00]: He's been there, I'd say, twenty-some years.

168
00:12:54,505 --> 00:12:56,047
[SPEAKER_00]: He's been in there.

169
00:12:58,148 --> 00:12:59,569
[SPEAKER_00]: He worked every day.

170
00:13:00,110 --> 00:13:03,573
[SPEAKER_00]: Well, he had to because we had ten children.

171
00:13:04,593 --> 00:13:06,255
