174
00:13:13,053 --> 00:13:14,113
[SPEAKER_02]: Which one were you in then?

175
00:13:14,553 --> 00:13:24,116
[SPEAKER_00]: Well, it was my brother Harry, then my brother Bill, both of those are dead, and then my brother Joe, my brother Tony.

176
00:13:24,696 --> 00:13:29,218
[SPEAKER_02]: I was the fifth one.

177
00:13:29,438 --> 00:13:30,938
