185
00:13:46,394 --> 00:13:50,875
[SPEAKER_00]: Well, now my mother, see, she's in a nursing home there in Reading now.

186
00:13:50,895 --> 00:13:51,716
[SPEAKER_00]: Is she still living there?

187
00:13:51,876 --> 00:13:54,077
